    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名成员"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "伊葵\n阿霍布的双生妹妹，也是一位前任首领。她曾与初代火神，",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7074,
        "name": "希巴拉克",
        "desc": "<p>曾击败「焰主」，并于烈焰中复活的初代火神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/326985891/e7f7eee058f60fc225b1f5bc654a08e0_644236905823485778.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "并肩作战，后来因保护龙众而违抗哥哥与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7296,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的命令。最终，她被哥哥杀害。\n萨库科\n「重铸和平者」，也是一位击败灰烬城统治者的六位英雄之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7492,
        "name": "松伽塔",
        "desc": "<p>回声之子的首领，继承古名「<custom-ruby data-ruby=\"巴|祝|莱|福|卡\"></custom-ruby>」纳塔的六英杰之一。他于五百年前灾变中牺牲。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/10/26/326985891/635c5399fafe1d44199f06a2bf16c6d4_794074292931464596.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "曾与特诺切一同于500年前",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7089,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "期间，前往未来烬寂海的前任部族首领。他的伙伴是一只嵴峰龙，穆胡鲁。\n陶奥鲁\n回声之子的传奇长老，于500年前灾变期间，曾与来自",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4811,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 22
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的战士并肩作战。根据传说中，陶奥鲁以「缝影针」击败了火山大王。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7014,
        "name": "帕加尔",
        "desc": "<p>回声之子的首领。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/02/326985891/3296b28bfb8e8444dae41f9b34214595_3502577666903640348.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部落首领",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6924,
        "name": "希诺宁",
        "desc": "纳茨卡延的铸名师，善于在工作的重担与舒适的生活之间找到平衡点。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/25/b07074c2b9040516fd240b6b8d65c011_2487211347344319683.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部族里最著名的「铸名师」，能够铸造「古名」。她是回声之子的英雄，其古名\n也被认可。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6318,
        "name": "卡齐娜",
        "desc": "纳茨卡延的年轻战士，受赐古名「乌沙博蒂」。善良执着的少女，在挫折中不断成长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/23/26925adb1092d29c8afdf46d92fad8bd_343637410022641529.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在「巡夜者战争」中赢得胜利的纳塔英雄。她的古名是\n。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7018,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "部族的叙事人。 根据推测，他于大约490年前去了 ， 现在他的“面具”被 使用。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7017,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "龙遗物研究协会的研究员，负责考察一些部族的风俗。 他生活于1000年前，现在他的“面具”被 使用。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
